## Push Button Wiring

Each push button is connected using the internal pull-up resistor of the ESP32.

| Button | Function | ESP32 Pin |
|---|---|---|
| Button A | Select / Shoot / Jump | GPIO25 |
| Button Up | Move Up / Menu Up | GPIO26 |
| Button Down | Move Down / Menu Down | GPIO27 |
| Button Back | Return to Menu | GPIO14 |

